  "content": {
    "id": "p7-q2-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "2",
    "prompt": "The depth of water in Dolphin Bay varies according to the tides. The depth is modelled by the equation $x=2\\cos\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{7}t\\right)+8$, where $x$ metres is the depth and $t$ hours is the time since the last high tide. Last Saturday, it was high tide at 7 am.",
    "layout": "grid",
    "columns": 2,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p7-q2-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "How deep is the bay at high tide?",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$10$ metres.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}x(0)&=2\\cos(0)+8\\\\&=10\\text{ metres}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 14
      },
      {
        "id": "p7-q2-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "How deep is the bay at low tide?",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$6$ metres.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}x(7)&=2\\cos\\pi+8\\\\&=6\\text{ metres}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 14
      },
      {
        "id": "p7-q2-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "When did the first low tide after 7 am occur?",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$2$ pm.",
          "worked": "Low tide occurs when $\\cos\\left(\\frac{\\pi t}{7}\\right)=-1$. For the first low tide,\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{\\pi t}{7}&=\\pi\\\\t&=7\\text{ hours}.\\end{align*}$$\nSeven hours after 7 am is 2 pm.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 23
      },
      {
        "id": "p7-q2-d",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "d",
        "prompt": "At what time last Saturday morning was the depth 9 metres?",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$9{:}20$ am.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}9&=2\\cos\\left(\\frac{\\pi t}{7}\\right)+8\\\\\\cos\\left(\\frac{\\pi t}{7}\\right)&=\\frac12\\\\\\frac{\\pi t}{7}&=\\frac{\\pi}{3}\\\\t&=\\frac73\\\\&=2\\frac13\\text{ hours}.\\end{align*}$$\nThis is 2 hours 20 minutes after 7 am, so the time was 9:20 am.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 31
      }
    ]
  },
